    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061102.0342\n\nCAIRO, Nov. 2 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nEgypt wins women's 100m hurdle in under-21 Arab athletics\n\n\n\n\nEgypt grabbed the gold medal of the women's 100m hurdle at the 12th under-21 Arab track and field championship here on Thursday, MENA news agency reported.\n\nSalma Emam Abul-Hasan came first in the race. Syria's Fadwa Ibrahim trailed second while Egyptian Nagla Khalifa finished third.\n\nThe four-day Arab Junior Athletics Championship, which began on Wednesday, drew some 500 Arab athletes representing 15 Arab nations.",
